msgctxt "96"
msgid ""
"I can't believe it! The master was right about you... You won, fair and "
"square."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "108"
msgid ""
"I thought I had studied the Komaki style longer than almost anyone, but I "
"know now that I've still got a lot to learn."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "120"
msgid "Looks like I'd forgotten what it's like to be in a real fight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132"
msgid "Heh... That was a good workout, though. Thanks for that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "144"
msgid ""
"Fighting you has really gotten my blood pumping! It makes me want to come "
"out of retirement!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "156"
msgid "I'm sure you could go right back into training if you wanted to."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "168"
msgid ""
"Thank you for everything! Oops! I'd better get back inside. My boss is "
"gonna be pissed... But feel free to come back to visit⑬as a customer next "
"time!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "180"
msgid "I will. Good luck."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "204"
msgid ""
"Fighting him dredged up memories of one of the Komaki techniques I used to "
"know..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "216"
msgid ""
"You can now use <Color:9>Komaki Tiger Drop<Color:Default>. Hold "
"<Action:Battle_Fight_Stance@Combat> to go into a fighting stance, then "
"press <Action:Battle_Heavy_Attack@Combat> as an enemy attacks to unleash it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "252"
msgid "Well, I'd better find the next student."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "264"
msgid ""
"I've defeated all of the old man's pupils. I'd better get back to the "
"Komaki Dojo."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "276"
msgid ""
"It looks like I win this one. Maybe you are a little rusty after all, heh! "
"Come back anytime. I'll take you on whenever you want."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "288"
msgid "(I lost. I should try fighting him again sometime.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "360"
msgid "Here should work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "372"
msgid "I'm not gonna hold back! Let's do this!"
msgstr ""

